          "text": "• Oral: 250 to 750 mg every 12 hours; IV: 400 mg every 8 to 12 hours.\n• Uncomplicated cystitis (when no other option): 250 mg every 12 hours for 3 days.\n• Pyelonephritis and complicated UTI: 500 mg orally every 12 hours (or 400 mg IV every 12 hours) for 7 days.\n• Pseudomonas aeruginosa: 750 mg orally every 12 hours, or 400 mg IV every 8 hours.\n• Post-exposure prophylaxis for meningococcal contacts: 500 mg orally as a single dose; plague and anthrax: 500 mg orally every 12 hours, or 400 mg IV every 12 hours, per public health guidance.\n• Take with water; avoid taking with dairy or calcium-fortified drinks alone."
